["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ellen Correia Golay on All-to-All Trading and Treasury Market Liquidity all-to-all trading off-the-run principal trading firms (PTFs) central clearing cheapest to deliver agent clearing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-macromusings-美债市场真正的瓶颈-不是规模-是中间商不够用了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/236f8c497eab5e75-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">47:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Macro Musings</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>美債市場真正的瓶頸：不是規模，是中間商不夠用了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一級交易商的資產負債表早已跟不上美債存量的增速，做市商讓位給高頻交易商，但後者在2020年3月集體撤退——這才是美債流動性問題的核心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美債</span><span class=\"tag\">市場結構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"This is how you rule the world pre-idea funding SAFE check Tree Hacks duck syndrome wantrepreneur\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-grayarea-斯坦福有一门秘密课程-教12个人如何从他人身上提取价值/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c8b1deddea1e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>斯坦福有一門秘密課程，教12個人如何從他人身上提取價值</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這門課不寫進課程目錄，每年只收 12 人，由一位硅谷 CEO 教怎麼從人身上提取價值。作者說，學生撒謊不是意外，而是這套機制長期獎勵的結果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷</span><span class=\"tag\">斯坦福</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How LA Is Quietly Becoming America&#x27;s New Industrial Tech Hub fourth turning vertical integration lights out digital twin CapEx\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-oddlots-美国制造业空心化不是能力问题-是金融回报问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">36:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>美國製造業空心化不是能力問題，是金融回報問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chris Power 說美國把工業政策當對沖基金的財務報表來管，中國把工業政策當國家安全來管；關稅只是不完美的糾偏工具，核心是讓美國消費者不再補貼對手的工業能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">再工業化</span><span class=\"tag\">製造業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Banza: Brian Rudolph. The Chickpea Pasta That Nearly Turned to Mush elimination diet glyphosate Detox Project natural channel\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-howibuilt-把鹰嘴豆意面煮成糊后-他靠-像泡茶一样泡-活了下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aedd4aae43a50f3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">58:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>把鷹嘴豆意麵煮成糊後，他靠「像泡茶一樣泡」活了下來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Banza 的第一次規模化生產全線失敗，20,000 盒意麵一煮就爛。他們沒銷燬，而是貼上一張「像泡茶一樣泡」的貼紙發貨——因為不發貨就永遠失去這個零售商。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費品</span><span class=\"tag\">食品創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"20VC: Why AI Cannot Replace Humans in Enterprise | Why Work Processes Not Models Will Be The Most Valuable Asset in AI | Why Europe Has Lost and Building in the US vs EU with Daniel Dines, UiPath map of work cartography credentialed middle vibe coding\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-twentyvc-ai-不会取代人-取代人的是没被写下来的工作/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c70932bbba8f0291-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不會取代人，取代人的是沒被寫下來的工作</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型可以互換，真正值錢的是企業把工作流程寫成手冊——這份「工作地圖」才是 AI 時代不可替代的資產，也是企業自己訓練模型的唯一前提。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業AI</span><span class=\"tag\">自動化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Hemp-THC businesses are bracing for a near total ban full-spectrum CBD Delta-8 economies of scale California sober\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-indicator-大麻合法州也躲不过-联邦禁令要清空-thc-货架/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">8:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Indicator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>大麻合法州也躲不過：聯邦禁令要清空 THC 貨架</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2018 年農業法案的漏洞讓 hemp 衍生 THC 長成 280 億美元產業，如今國會要堵上它——連大麻合法的州也會因為失去便宜替代品而漲價。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">監管</span><span class=\"tag\">大麻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ep. 400: Dennett Rejects Qualia (Part Two) qualia heterophenomenology Cartesian theater Umwelt / Innenwelt panpsychism philosophical zombie\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-pel-蝙蝠自己也不知道当蝙蝠是什么感觉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/32cd9ba9b1ae4d6b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>蝙蝠自己也不知道當蝙蝠是什麼感覺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蝙蝠論證靠的是一個永遠無法通達的私有內核；Dennett 說這個內核根本不存在，蝙蝠對自己也不是一種「感覺起來像什麼」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">意識哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">感受質</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise and Fall of the Ming Dynasty Kaogong Ji dogong hutong feng shui\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-historyhit-北京中轴线不是古迹-是仍在运转的城市操作系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/647317f0dd4bb22e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">55:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>北京中軸線不是古蹟，是仍在運轉的城市操作系統</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">明朝按兩千年前的《考工記》藍圖重建北京，中軸線至今決定這座兩千萬人城市的對稱與生長，連奧運鳥巢都建在這條線上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市規劃</span><span class=\"tag\">中軸線</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Germany’s Chancellor Has No Authority Left Volksparteien AfD Die Linke SED\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-goodfight-德国基民盟跌出州议会-中间派时代已经结束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>德國基民盟跌出州議會：中間派時代已經結束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基民盟在梅前州得票不到5%，建國以來首次被擋在州議會門外。默茨權威已失，而民粹極左極右在35歲以下選民中拿下壓倒性多數。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">德國政治</span><span class=\"tag\">民粹主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"239. 對話衛哲｜中國品牌出海，為什麼“選擇”比“努力”更重要？ tokenized 價性比 四個單一 產品3.0\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-beiwanglu-出海别等做大了再去欧美-先去欧美才能做大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c56ff7e702000290-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"貝\"><span class=\"dur\">50:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">貝望錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>出海別等做大了再去歐美，先去歐美才能做大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">衛哲說，很多公司以為做大了才去歐美，其實正好反了——你去歐美才能做大。地區選擇錯了，後面的產品3.0、渠道金字塔都搭不起來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">跨境電商</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"275.AI辦公的熱鬧還沒散，個人Agent的戰爭已經開始｜拆解Town、Instinct、Grok Bot與Muse Personal Agent harness MCP Browser Use Computer Use context\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-luanfanshu-10万用户估值100亿-个人agent的估值跑在产品前面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/369180a93673e434-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"亂\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">亂翻書</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>10萬用戶估值100億：個人Agent的估值跑在產品前面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Instinct 用戶不到 10 萬、產品還沒正式上線，估值半年從 5000 萬美金漲到 100 億美金——這一輪個人 Agent 的熱度裡，資本搶船票的成分大於真實需求。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">AI創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"10 Years, 10 Lessons: Everything I Got Wrong About Parenting RIE authoritative parenting authoritarian parenting Special Time Gottman method\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-parentmojo-育儿十年才懂-孩子不听话时-问题不在孩子身上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">49:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>育兒十年才懂：孩子不聽話時，問題不在孩子身上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">播客十週年，主持人復盤十條自己曾深信不疑的育兒觀念——從強迫孩子吃藥到把專家框架當真理，每條都是先在書裡學一遍、再在真實衝突裡重學一遍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">親子關係</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"897: Intergenerational Space Travel Gen Alpha walk-up song\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-tal-npr-评论区被当成机器人-其实是一群初中生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b461c033eddd711d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>NPR 評論區被當成機器人，其實是一群初中生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">NPR 員工看到評論區一堆亂碼，第一反應是機器人並舉報；一個年輕同事認出那是被家長屏蔽社交媒體的孩子，把 Spotify 評論區當群聊用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">代際差異</span><span class=\"tag\">平臺行為</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"“我看到了 Scaling Law 的信號” | 對談清華叉院助理教授徐夢迪：具身智能、世界模型、真正的泛化 In-Context Learning VLA UMI MAML algorithm distillation no free lunch\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-20-crossing-机器人还在-gpt-1-阶段-真正的信号是成功率不是-loss/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/16b239cce425bd9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"十\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">十字路口Crossing</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>機器人還在 GPT-1 階段，真正的信號是成功率不是 Loss</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">具身智能的 Scaling Law 信號已經出現，但測的指標錯了：Loss 低不等於成功率低，中間 17 步不接觸物體的擬合毫無意義。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anthony Scaramucci and Tina Brown on How To Fix America, Live in London Nerd Reich gerrymandering pay-as-you-go Citizens United\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-20-iq2-特朗普若连任美国会更好-他的前通讯主任这样算账/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e26fa34479162479-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普若連任美國會更好？他的前通訊主任這樣算賬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Scaramucci 認為特朗普第二任期更危險，因為他學會了「上次偷的錢不夠多」；而民主黨輸在候選人不敢冒險，哈里斯拒絕上 Fox 和播客。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國政治</span><span class=\"tag\">特朗普</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"707. The Terror: An Assassination in Paris (Part 1) assignat sans-culottes conciergerie federalist revolts\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-20-restishistory-刺杀马拉的女人-为什么法庭不信她独自行动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>刺殺馬拉的女人，為什麼法庭不信她獨自行動</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科黛行刺前就寫好了宣言，被捕後堅持獨自行動，革命法庭卻反覆追問「陰謀的鏈條」——他們無法想像外省人會認為馬拉是怪物。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法國大革命</span><span class=\"tag\">恐怖統治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Intel’s Optane Memory: A Promise Unfulfilled 3D XPoint Phase Change Memory Storage Class Memory App Direct Mode Compute Express Link\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-20-asianometry-intel-的-optane-死于-3d-nand-太便宜-不是技术不行/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db7d41e9cab4af1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">30:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>Intel 的 Optane 死於 3D NAND 太便宜，不是技術不行</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">相變存儲從 1970 年做到 2022 年，每次都是被更便宜的閃存擠死。3D XPoint 卡在 NAND 和 DRAM 中間，兩頭都不如，最後連 Intel 自己都放棄了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">存儲芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">Intel</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"E200 Ai芯片、中國算力和《昇騰崛起》 | 永慶對話方興東 CANN 掏定律 紅軍藍軍 軟硬協同\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-20-touzishizhan-华为昇腾选了一条最难的路-不兼容英伟达/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0eba610a53c6a762-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">投資實戰派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>華為昇騰選了一條最難的路：不兼容英偉達</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國IT業三四十年都是追隨，昇騰是華為第一款不解決卡脖子、而是主動去無人區跟英偉達同時起步的產品。徐直軍說，但凡做追隨的事情，總是越做越累。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">華為</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Adam Foroughi, Applovin CEO: Surviving a 92% Drawdown, Ads as ML 1.0 &amp; the $50B Game Ad Market EBIDTA ML 1.0 agentic commerce discovery\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-20-allin-广告是机器学习的-1-0-applovin-靠它赚出-84-利润率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/283684b03f4288e2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">23:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>廣告是機器學習的 1.0：AppLovin 靠它賺出 84% 利潤率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">廣告不是 AI 的過去式，而是深度學習最早、最賺錢的落地場景。AppLovin 用推薦模型在 50 億美元的手遊廣告市場裡做出 84% 的 EBIDTA 利潤率，並靠 60 億美元回購成為自己最好的投資人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>13</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">廣告技術</span><span class=\"tag\">推薦系統</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Buffets Suddenly Disappeared Chapter 11 same store sales unit economics fast casual\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-20-modernmba-自助餐不是被吃垮的-是被超市熟食区掏空的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a28230a043a0573d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">38:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Modern MBA</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>自助餐不是被吃垮的，是被超市熟食區掏空的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">80 年代自助餐靠廉價食材、廉價土地、廉價勞工和停滯的工資撐起，四個輸入全部漲價後，真正殺死它的是超市用零獲客成本的熟食區吃掉了低價市場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">餐飲</span><span class=\"tag\">消費</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"90 minutes of unfiltered product advice from Snap and Discord’s product chief | Peter Sellis modified VCG long-term greedy DAU/MAU innovator&#x27;s dilemma\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-20-lennys-协作越多越慢-snap-和-discord-产品一号位反直觉管理法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/30c121c603612432-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>協作越多越慢：Snap 和 Discord 產品一號位反直覺管理法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">協作有沒人內化的隱藏成本，協調成本保證你只能以系統裡最慢節點的速度前進。所以 Peter Sellis 會有意識地激進內化協作成本，而不是默認協作越多越好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品管理</span><span class=\"tag\">組織設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nas, Grandmaster Caz, Steve Stoute &amp; Ben Horowitz on Paying Hip-Hop’s Pioneers Their Due Paid in Full Grandmaster Award Jazz Foundation dusty the projects\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-20-a16z-给嘻哈元老发钱-他们以为是诈骗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">57:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>給嘻哈元老發錢，他們以為是詐騙</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">有人因為不信這是真的，連獎都沒來領。因為在嘻哈圈直接給錢行不通——Nas 的說法是，先得把認可和尊嚴給足，錢才收得下。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">嘻哈文化</span><span class=\"tag\">創作者經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Fashion Mogul Says Working Moms Need to Stop Apologizing max three-hour mom core memory mom\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-20-wsjournal-时尚大亨-当妈不必道歉-钱要开口谈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>時尚大亨：當媽不必道歉，錢要開口談</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Emma Grede 說女性避談錢，錢就避開你；她靠主動談錢、選對合夥人、做別人懶得做的生意，把被忽視的顧客變成忠誠復購。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">名人合夥</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"We Can&#x27;t Lose Control of A.I. recursive self-improvement (RSI) alignment paperclip maximizer chain of thought\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-20-ezra-ai-实验室正把控制权交出去-而且越快越好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>AI 實驗室正把控制權交出去，而且越快越好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">實驗室一邊說 AI 可能滅絕人類，一邊把寫代碼的活交給 AI，因為誰先實現遞歸自我改進誰就贏。這不是意外，是產品路線。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">遞歸自我改進</span>\n</div></div></a>"]